cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "newsvoice: Voice and attribution extraction from news text"
abstract: >-
  A layered pipeline for extracting voice and attribution from news text.
  Identifies direct and indirect quotation, resolves speakers to canonical
  actors through coreference and alias resolution, and classifies the
  explicitness, position and completeness of each attribution. Returns one row
  per attribution with character offsets into the source, so every extracted
  segment is traceable to the discourse it came from.
authors:
